OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fnight with only western hills seeing
OL,7,Fthe odd spot of light rain. Clear
OL,8,Fspells elsewhere, with the odd mist
OL,9,Fand fog patch forming in rural areas.
OL,10,FLight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMany areas dry with long
OL,13,Fsunny spells, with the odd shower
OL,14,Fpossible in Cumbria in the morning.
OL,15,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine with
OL,16,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
