OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry and
OL,6,Fsettled to end the week, with sunny
OL,7,Fspells each day. Overnight, fog and
OL,8,Fmist forming, this perhaps lingering
OL,9,Fthrough the mornings. Cloudier with
OL,10,Frain possible on Sunday.
